your body moving!\n\n\n\n**Features**\n\n- **Beatrect is easy to play!**\n\nJump into the action without complicated rules - Perfect for beginners and casual players!\n\n- **Hone your skills and challenge yourself!**\n\nFind your own way to play the levels and move up in the ranks!\n\n- **Get ready for the never-before-seen visuals!**\n\nThis new ray-tracing based graphic technology will shock and amaze you!\n\n- **Create your own original levels!**\n\nEveryone has a chance to be featured on the official levels page!\n\n\nPlay with no hesitation!\nPlay for the love of music!", "short_description": "Introducing Beatrect!\nthe Rhythm Action Game for music lovers and note-slashers both old and new!\nSlash the notes without complicated rules. Experience a whole new ray-tracing based graphic."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.privacypolicies.com/live/77792f91-721d-441d-b29d-c505a4e07e86", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://ash-tulip-d32.notion.site/EULA-23d1bd1f5fb34fc3a9b69f9d2f0f926c?pvs=4", "publisher_name": "Farseer Co., Ltd.", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://ash-tulip-d32.notion.site/f794e58b49eb440fa2c8eda3faa76259", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1672577396871977"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "REQUIRED_FOR_SOME_CONTENT", "genres": ["ACTION", "ARCADE", "MUSIC"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "7781552705284619"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 0, "nod